{"slug":"Leetcode-149-Max-Points-on-a-Line","title":"Leetcode#149. Max Points on a Line","date":"2023-08-18","updated":"","tags":["Leetcode","Python","hard","💡","Array","Hash Table","Math","Geometry"],"categories":["Leetcode"],"cover":"/img/cover/leetcode.jpg","excerpt":"Given an array of where represents a point on the X-Y plane, return the maximum number of points that lie on the same straight line. Example 1: Example 2: Constraints: - - - - All the are unique. 找到最多","sticky":0,"contentHtml":"<h1 id=\"problem\"><a href=\"#problem\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Problem</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<p>Given an array of <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>points</span></span></code></span> where <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>points[i] = [xi, yi]</span></span></code></span> represents a point on the <strong>X-Y</strong> plane, return <em>the maximum number of points that lie on the same straight line</em>.</p>\n<p><strong>Example 1:</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2021/02/25/plane1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2021/02/25/plane1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: points = [[1,1],[2,2],[3,3]]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: 3</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Example 2:</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2021/02/25/plane2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2021/02/25/plane2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: points = [[1,1],[3,2],[5,3],[4,1],[2,3],[1,4]]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: 4</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>1 &#x3C;= points.length &#x3C;= 300</span></span></code></span></li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>points[i].length == 2</span></span></code></span></li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>10^4 &#x3C;= xi, yi &#x3C;= 10^4</span></span></code></span></li>\n<li>All the <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>points</span></span></code></span> are <strong>unique</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"solve\"><a href=\"#solve\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Solve</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<h3 id=\"法一\"><a href=\"#法一\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>法一</span></span></code></span></a></h3>\n<p>找到最多</p>\n<p>兩點斜率公式 y = tan * x + res             ( y = a x  + b)</p>\n<p>“#” 為垂直線</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">class</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B\"> Solution</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> maxPoints</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B;font-style:italic\">self</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">points</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: List[List[</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]]) -> </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\">\t\t\t\t# At least the last point, if the list is not empty</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        max_value </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(points)):</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">            memo </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> {}</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">( i </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> ,</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(points)):</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                dx </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> points[i][</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">points[j][</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                dy </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> points[i][</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">points[j][</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> dx </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">==</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                    if</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"#\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">,</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">points[i][</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> memo:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                        memo[(</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"#\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">,</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">points[i][</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">])] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                    else</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                        memo[(</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"#\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">,</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">points[i][</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">])] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 2</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                else</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                    tan </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> dy </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">/</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> dx</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                    res </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> points[i][</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> tan</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">*</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">points[i][</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                    if</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> (tan , res) </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> memo:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                        memo[(tan,res)] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                    else</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                        memo[(tan,res)] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 2</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                </span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> memo:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                max_value </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(max_value , </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">max</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(memo.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">values</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">()))</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">            </span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> max_value</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Time complexity :</p>\n<p>O( n^2)</p>\n<h3 id=\"優化\"><a href=\"#優化\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>優化</span></span></code></span></a></h3>\n<p>發現 res 根本不重要</p>\n<p>畢竟在 第 i 點上</p>\n<p>所以res 一定一樣</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">class</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B\"> Solution</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> maxPoints</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B;font-style:italic\">self</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">points</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: List[List[</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]]) -> </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        max_value </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(points)):</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">            memo </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> {}</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">( i </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> ,</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(points)):</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                dx </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> points[i][</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">points[j][</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                dy </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> points[i][</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">points[j][</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> dx </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">==</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                    if</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> \"#\"</span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> memo:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                        memo[</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"#\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                    else</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                        memo[</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"#\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 2</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                else</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                    tan </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> dy </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">/</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> dx</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                    if</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> (tan) </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> memo:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                        memo[tan] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                    else</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                        memo[tan] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 2</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                        </span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> memo:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                max_value </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(max_value , </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">max</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(memo.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">values</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">()))</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">            </span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> max_value</span></span></code></pre></figure>"}